ay to Tokyo to marry him. Her revelation was not only surprising but also reminded the deepest part of Kaoru's memory for why he left the Hanabishi family in the first place."},"tags":[{"name":"Female Harem","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"College","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Ai Yori Aoshi","english":"Ai Yori Aoshi","native":"藍より青し","romaji":"Ai Yori Aoshi","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"青出于蓝"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"未婚关系"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}